      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A reverse provision question asks for the original group.\n\nSuppose a fort has food for 40 more days after 10 days have passed. Then 500 reinforcements arrive and the remaining stock lasts 35 days. If original strength is x: x×40 = (x+500)×35.",
