    "teach_8": {
      "id": "teach_8",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Capstone: a desertion question can look paradoxical.\n\nAfter 10 days, one-fifth of the people leave, yet the remaining food is said to last until the same final day as originally planned. That longer remaining duration balances the smaller population.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
